  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 25*15*5*4*16*21\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1): +, ÷, ×, –,=\n\n25*15*5*4*16*21 ⇒ 25 + 15 ÷ 5 × 4 – 16 = 21 \n\n⇒ 25 + __**15 **____**÷ **____**5**__ × 4 – 16 = 21 \n\n⇒ 25 + __**3**____** × **____**4**__ – 16 = 21 \n\n⇒ __**25 + 12**__ – 16 = 21 \n\n⇒ __**37**____** – **____**16**__ = 21 \n\n**⇒ 21 = 21 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2): ÷, –, ×, +, =\n\n25*15*5*4*16*21 ⇒ 25 ÷ 15 – 5 × 4 + 16 = 21\n\n⇒ __**25 ÷ **____**15**__ – 5 × 4 + 16 = 21\n\n⇒ 1.67 – __**5 × **____**4**__ + 16 = 21\n\n⇒ __**1.67**____** + 16**__ – 20 = 21\n\n⇒ __**17.67**____** – 10**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 7.67 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3): +, ×, –, =, ÷\n\n25*15*5*4*16*21 ⇒ 25 + 15 × 5 – 4 = 16 ÷ 21\n\n⇒ 25 + __**15 × 5**__ – 4 = __**16 ÷ 21**__\n\n⇒ __**25 + 75**__ – 4 = 0.76\n\n⇒ __100____** – 4**__ = 0.76\n\n⇒ 96 ≠ 0.76 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4): +, –, ×, ÷, =\n\n25*15*5*4*16*21 ⇒ 25 + 15 – 5 × 4 ÷ 16 = 21\n\n⇒ 25 + 15 – 5 × __**4 ÷ 16**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 25 + 15 – __**5 × 0.25**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**25 + 15**__ – 1.25 = 21\n\n⇒ __40____** – 1.25**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 38.75 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
